cur at downtown Wilmington within a week of the crest at Lock 1. "}, {"stage": 26, "statement": "Highway 11 will begin to flood between the Cape Fear River and Natmore Road.  Other roads near Kelly and Canetuck may flood.  Moderate flooding of swamps and low lands. Flooding similar to that reached with the remnants of Hurricane Hilda in 1964. "}, {"stage": 24, "statement": "24 Water will top the lock at Lock and Dam 1 near Kelly.  Widespread lowland flooding will occur along the river. North Elwell Ferry Road will be flooded on both sites of the river near the ferry landing. "}, {"stage": 20, "statement": "North Elwell Ferry Road will likely be flooded north of the river near the ferry landing. Lowland flooding along the river. "}, {"stage": 19, "statement": "North Elwell Ferry Road will begin to flood north of the river near the ferry landing. Lowland flooding along the river. "}]}, "images": {"probability": {"weekint": {"stage": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/probabilistic/exceedance/CPFN7.SSTG.prob.weekint.gif", "flow": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/probabilistic/exceedance/CPFN7.QINE.prob.weekint.gif", "volume": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/probabilistic/exceedance/CPFN7.volume.prob.weekint.gif"}, "entperiod": {"stage": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/probabilistic/exceedance/CPFN7.SSTG.exceed.90day.gif", "flow": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/probabilistic/exceedance/CPFN7.QINE.exceed.90day.gif", "volume": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/probabilistic/exceedance/CPFN7.volume.exceed.90day.gif"}, "shortrange": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/probabilistic/short_term/CPFN7.shortrange.hefs.png"}, "hydrograph": {"default": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/hydrographs/cpfn7_hg.png", "floodcat": "https://water.noaa.gov/resources/hydrographs/cpfn7_record.png"}, "photos": [{"id": "1484025317628580334", "type": "Feature", "geometry": {"type": "Point", "coordinates": [34.404444444444, -78.293611111111]}, "properties": {"image": "https://water.noaa.go